WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.970
- So Brendan, have you
seen "Stranger Things"

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.680
before you met on the movie?

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.513
- Yes, I have.

00:00:05.513 --> 00:00:07.200
I saw the first season in its entirety.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.840
I loved it 'cause I grew up
playing Dungeons and Dragons,

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.530
and the whole ensemble of
Stranger Things reminded me

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.570
of the crew that I used
to run around with.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:20.106
And I lived in Seattle,
Washington in the late '70s.

00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:21.870
So it was nostalgia for me.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.130
I loved it.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.010
And then after we finished "The Whale,"

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.250
a certain Sadie Sink went on to stare down

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.611
a really scary monster called Vecna.

00:00:33.611 --> 00:00:38.611
And I know that's
because she had just come

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.440
from playing Charlie's daughter,

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.020
who has a great deal of finally focused

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.280
anger issues with her father.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.770
So I think Sadie
definitely carried her work

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:54.750
from one project into the other,

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.630
'cause that Vecna guy ran with
his tail between his legs.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:58.463
And I know why,

00:00:58.463 --> 00:01:01.140
and it's not just because
her dad is a football coach,

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:04.530
and has a handshake like a stonemason.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.783
I know, 'cause this hand still hurts.

